(alts &centers
  (alt &centers=$Derived
    (witness centers=RarestColor ordinary concept
      (separates "The 2 has a single 3. Rarest colors are 1, 2 and 3, so the rarest-centers reading takes the 3 for a center and leaves it in place. The stored center set pulls the 3 beside the 2. The derived pairing also pairs 3 with 2 and copies the 2 beside the 3.")
